01:17:52.520 --> 01:17:58.300
Rep. Ma. Victoria Co-Pilar: will be truly a privatization of the said IBC 13.

asr-002025
01:17:59.240 --> 01:18:02.080
Secretary David M. Gomez: Thank you very much, Your Honor. Thank you very much. And from

asr-002026
01:18:02.080 --> 01:18:06.980
Secretary David M. Gomez: the PCO and from myself personally, I can assure you that the number

asr-002027
01:18:06.980 --> 01:18:11.620
