asr-002028
01:18:11.620 --> 01:18:15.980
Secretary David M. Gomez: if they will not be absorbed by whoever management will take over, we

asr-002029
01:18:15.980 --> 01:18:19.200
Secretary David M. Gomez: will definitely find ways to take care and look after their welfare.

asr-002030
01:18:19.460 --> 01:18:26.740
Secretary David M. Gomez: And secondly my personal assurance, Your Honor my personal assurance that if and

asr-002031
01:18:26.740 --> 01:18:30.360
Secretary David M. Gomez: when that happens Congress TV will move to PTV4.

asr-002032
01:18:30.360 --> 01:18:39.460
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Thank you, Representative Victoria, Vice Chair. Sorry, Representative Victoria.

asr-002033
01:18:39.460 --> 01:18:44.600
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: So next, we now recognize Representative Brian Llamanzariz.

asr-002034
01:18:47.490 --> 01:18:49.270
Rep. Brian Poe: Maraming salamat po, Madam Chair.

asr-002035
01:18:50.150 --> 01:18:54.930
Rep. Brian Poe: First, I'd like to thank our Secretary and

asr-002036
01:18:54.930 --> 01:19:03.690
