asr-002072
01:21:35.230 --> 01:21:41.890
Secretary David M. Gomez: when we inquired, the premise was because the station was up for privatization.

asr-002073
01:21:41.890 --> 01:21:48.330
Secretary David M. Gomez: And as I was explaining earlier, with the few months remaining for the year,

asr-002074
01:21:48.770 --> 01:21:52.710
Secretary David M. Gomez: it may be unlikely that we may be able to conclude

asr-002075
01:21:52.710 --> 01:21:55.730
Secretary David M. Gomez: the privatization by December 31st this year.

asr-002076
01:21:55.930 --> 01:22:01.490
Secretary David M. Gomez: And with zero budget, what does that leave us in terms of salaries of our people,

asr-002077
01:22:01.670 --> 01:22:03.330
Secretary David M. Gomez: the upkeep of the station?

asr-002078
01:22:03.330 --> 01:22:11.670
Secretary David M. Gomez: So we're really appealing to the committee if we can restore a certain amount of the budget

asr-002079
01:22:11.670 --> 01:22:16.230
Secretary David M. Gomez: originally requested by the station with the Department of Budget and Management.

asr-002080
01:22:16.230 --> 01:22:22.510
Secretary David M. Gomez: The figure that you mentioned, 460 plus, I believe is really to cover for that

asr-002081
01:22:22.510 --> 01:22:24.310
Secretary David M. Gomez: amount that was cut.

asr-002082
01:22:24.530 --> 01:22:27.390
Secretary David M. Gomez: But I'd like to also, with your permission,

asr-002083
01:22:27.550 --> 01:22:32.970
Secretary David M. Gomez: recognize the president of IBC 13 who can better explain what that 460 plus,

asr-002084
01:22:33.190 --> 01:22:38.970
Secretary David M. Gomez: which I believe he communicated already to the committee in a form of a request.

asr-002085
01:22:39.390 --> 01:22:40.330
Secretary David M. Gomez: Thank you, Your Honor.

asr-002086
01:22:40.890 --> 01:22:41.630
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Thank you.

asr-002087
01:22:45.770 --> 01:22:51.590
IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: With your respect, Secretary Dave, Madam Chairperson, honorable members of the committee,

asr-002088
01:22:51.930 --> 01:22:55.410
IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: we submitted the budget earlier around 660,

asr-002089
01:22:55.690 --> 01:23:03.150
IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: but based on the representation we made, we had to reduce and set aside our CAPEX.

asr-002090
