IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: We only, we had to maintain 131 million for personal services,

asr-002091
01:23:09.410 --> 01:23:13.370
IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: MOE of 223. It's

asr-002092
