IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: 15 and then one radio station, Your Honor.

asr-002095
01:23:25.970 --> 01:23:34.070
IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: And likewise, we have to answer in court a 50 million arbitration award

asr-002096
01:23:34.070 --> 01:23:44.250
IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: given to the retired employees that they submitted to arbitration.

asr-002097
01:23:44.450 --> 01:23:52.430
IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: So instead of paying more than 100 million, they agreed to around 49 million or rounded to 50 million.

asr-002098
01:23:52.430 --> 01:23:56.250
IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: For Congress TV, we have to allocate it also.

asr-002099
01:23:56.610 --> 01:24:02.710
IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: Otherwise, we have been doing a lot of service to Congress, likewise to the government,

asr-002100
01:24:03.030 --> 01:24:06.210
IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: and Congress TV is only one of the programs that we are supporting.

asr-002101
01:24:06.210 --> 01:24:13.430
IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: Together with the Senate, together with the e -government, e -gov that we maintain,

asr-002102
01:24:13.790 --> 01:24:20.350
IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: and other government -related programs, around 23 of them,

asr-002103
01:24:20.510 --> 01:24:24.130
IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: all station -produced programs, Your Honor.

asr-002104
01:24:24.830 --> 01:24:25.870
IBC President Jose C. "Jimmy" Policarpio Jr.: Thank you.

asr-002105
