asr-002109
01:24:47.910 --> 01:24:52.210
Rep. Brian Poe: We should be supporting this and financing it fully, if you ask me. They're

asr-002110
01:24:52.210 --> 01:24:53.910
Rep. Brian Poe: handling their budget better than most.

asr-002111
01:24:54.570 --> 01:24:56.050
Rep. Brian Poe: But, Madam Chair, there's

