asr-002121
01:25:29.750 --> 01:25:30.610
Secretary David M. Gomez: Thank you, Your Honor.

asr-002122
01:25:30.670 --> 01:25:31.890
Secretary David M. Gomez: I can confirm that, Your Honor.

asr-002123
01:25:31.890 --> 01:25:38.110
Secretary David M. Gomez: The BM approved the request of the PIA for a budget for the retrofitting of their building,

asr-002124
01:25:38.250 --> 01:25:42.770
Secretary David M. Gomez: a 44 -year -old building that's really in a very sad state at the moment.

asr-002125
01:25:43.490 --> 01:25:47.190
Secretary David M. Gomez: We finally got the budget for retrofitting.

asr-002126
01:25:47.730 --> 01:25:54.010
Secretary David M. Gomez: Unfortunately, the 20 million budget that the agency is asking for rent was not included.

asr-002127
01:25:54.450 --> 01:25:54.990
Secretary David M. Gomez: So,

asr-002128
01:25:55.030 --> 01:25:57.990
Secretary David M. Gomez: of course, when construction starts

asr-002129
01:25:57.990 --> 01:26:00.550
Secretary David M. Gomez: and they have no place to go,

asr-002130
01:26:00.550 --> 01:26:01.090
Secretary David M. Gomez: I mean,

asr-002131
01:26:01.150 --> 01:26:04.710
Secretary David M. Gomez: they cannot stop working or just work from home.

asr-002132
01:26:04.810 --> 01:26:08.590
Secretary David M. Gomez: We really need that money to look for office spaces

asr-002133
01:26:08.590 --> 01:26:11.570
Secretary David M. Gomez: to accommodate our staff from the PIA

asr-002134
01:26:11.570 --> 01:26:14.870
