asr-002135
01:26:14.870 --> 01:26:17.210
Secretary David M. Gomez: or retrofitting of the new building is ongoing.

asr-002136
01:26:18.370 --> 01:26:18.990
Rep. Brian Poe: Madam Chair,

asr-002137
01:26:19.190 --> 01:26:24.770
Rep. Brian Poe: I will not allow our PIA staff to go homeless.

asr-002138
01:26:25.010 --> 01:26:29.030
Rep. Brian Poe: And I'm sure this was just an oversight on the part of the DBM

asr-002139
01:26:29.030 --> 01:26:35.130
Rep. Brian Poe: because the intention to secure better facilities for the PIA is there. It's

asr-002140
01:26:35.130 --> 01:26:41.690
Rep. Brian Poe: just that they didn't notice that the MOE budget was lacking 20 million pesos just for rent.

asr-002141
01:26:41.810 --> 01:26:45.010
Rep. Brian Poe: And I think this is an easy fix for us this appropriation season.

asr-002142
01:26:45.490 --> 01:26:52.890
Rep. Brian Poe: Although I do want to weigh retrofitting versus just having a new building altogether.

asr-002143
01:26:53.470 --> 01:26:57.850
Rep. Brian Poe: Retrofitting a 40 plus year old building doesn't

asr-002146
01:26:57.850 --> 01:26:58.570
Rep. Brian Poe: sound very sound.

asr-002147
01:26:58.570 --> 01:27:00.890
Rep. Brian Poe: And I've seen the pictures and documentation.

asr-002148
01:27:01.190 --> 01:27:03.810
Rep. Brian Poe: Tama, this is the building that has bats in it, no?

asr-002149
01:27:04.550 --> 01:27:05.990
Rep. Brian Poe: They have a bat cave, Your Honor.

asr-002150
01:27:06.530 --> 01:27:08.130
Rep. Brian Poe: An actual bat cave?

asr-002151
01:27:08.390 --> 01:27:08.850
Rep. Brian Poe: Bat cave.

asr-002152
01:27:09.410 --> 01:27:14.030
Rep. Brian Poe: Do we have any pictures of that, Mr. Secretary? I'm

asr-002153
01:27:14.030 --> 01:27:18.230
Rep. Brian Poe: sure members of this committee don't believe how bad the condition is of the PIA.

asr-002154
01:27:18.450 --> 01:27:21.750
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: If I may ask representatives of the PIA to be recognized, Your Honor.

asr-002155
01:27:23.850 --> 01:27:24.590
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Go ahead.

asr-002156
01:27:25.930 --> 01:27:27.730
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: The representative from PIA.

