asr-002161
01:27:47.290 --> 01:27:52.390
PIA Assistant Director-General for External Affairs Kristine Venet Q. Andal: And kung hindi pa rin mapaalis, manual na po talaga nilang kukunin yung bats

asr-002162
01:27:52.390 --> 01:27:54.830
PIA Assistant Director-General for External Affairs Kristine Venet Q. Andal: pag nag -start na po yung rehab ng building,

asr-002163
01:27:54.950 --> 01:27:55.970
PIA Assistant Director-General for External Affairs Kristine Venet Q. Andal: Kong. Madam Chair.

asr-002164
01:27:56.710 --> 01:28:00.250
Rep. Brian Poe: to see this is exactly why we need to fix this,

asr-002165
01:28:00.370 --> 01:28:02.050
Rep. Brian Poe: either one of two things are gonna happen here,

asr-002166
01:28:02.150 --> 01:28:04.770
Rep. Brian Poe: either magkaroon tayo ng Batman or ng COVID ulit

asr-002167
01:28:04.770 --> 01:28:06.810
Rep. Brian Poe: kaya ayusin natin yan

asr-002168
01:28:07.610 --> 01:28:13.990
Rep. Brian Poe: so the other thing that I wanted to point out is that we have a new GM for PTV4

asr-002169
01:28:13.990 --> 01:28:17.470
Rep. Brian Poe: and a visionary at that who comes from the industry

asr-002170
01:28:18.210 --> 01:28:24.170
Rep. Brian Poe: and the problem is, we bring in a new GM with a new task of revolutionizing PTV4

asr-002171
01:28:24.170 --> 01:28:26.350
Rep. Brian Poe: and then we tell Tell him, by the way, there's no budget.

asr-002172
01:28:26.850 --> 01:28:28.250
Rep. Brian Poe: How does that work?

asr-002173
01:28:28.870 --> 01:28:36.130
Rep. Brian Poe: If I may ask, GM, you've, in your own private capacity, you've been meeting with industry leaders,

asr-002174
01:28:36.310 --> 01:28:38.270
Rep. Brian Poe: not just in the Philippines, but around the world.

asr-002175
01:28:38.390 --> 01:28:41.310
Rep. Brian Poe: What do they think about the current condition of PTV4?

asr-002176
01:28:42.990 --> 01:28:44.730
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-002177
01:28:46.210 --> 01:28:47.790
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: Una -una, thank you. I'm

