01:28:47.790 --> 01:28:52.370
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: among some of the best communicators in Congress. Congress. I've

asr-002179
01:28:52.370 --> 01:28:52.970
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: worked with

asr-002180
01:28:52.970 --> 01:28:55.830
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: Kong Brian in the private sector

asr-002181
01:28:55.830 --> 01:28:58.970
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: and he's known around the communication circles as well.

asr-002182
01:28:59.110 --> 01:29:03.090
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: So this is exactly the space where I think he's been thriving

asr-002183
01:29:03.090 --> 01:29:03.810
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: so he understands.

asr-002184
01:29:04.550 --> 01:29:09.070
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: Just a week ago, I met with the Asia -Pacific head of BBC Studios

asr-002185
01:29:09.070 --> 01:29:17.310
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: and basically with all our budget, we can probably buy one show or collaborate with one show.

asr-002186
01:29:17.810 --> 01:29:22.150
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: So we cannot build the network with a 138 million budget.

asr-002187
01:29:22.330 --> 01:29:23.610
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: But for perspective also,

asr-002188
01:29:23.890 --> 01:29:29.450
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: you were correct to compare us to our ASEAN neighbors. Di bali na yung

asr-002189
01:29:29.450 --> 01:29:39.210
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: BBC, di bali na yung NHK, but even Cambodia, even our neighbors spend billions in pesos

asr-002190
01:29:39.210 --> 01:29:44.170
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: for their state broadcasting system, their communication portals.

asr-002191
01:29:44.710 --> 01:29:47.290
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: For perspective also po, ang

asr-002192
