asr-002193
01:29:52.090 --> 01:29:53.570
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: And my heart aches

asr-002194
01:29:53.570 --> 01:29:56.430
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: when I hear my secretary say that the PCO budget is

asr-002195
01:29:56.430 --> 01:29:57.130
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: 0 .06.

asr-002196
01:29:57.790 --> 01:29:59.890
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: So ito ho yung nabanggit kanina.

asr-002197
01:30:00.000 --> 01:30:01.220
PTV General Manager Lino S. Cayetano: ng mga kasamaan natin

asr-002198
